# Project rules

- Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Zustand (UI only), Supabase, Vercel-only deploy.
- Agents follow AGENTS.md: design → plan → implement → `pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test`.
- No org/business schema until product is defined. Auth user only.
- No service-role keys in client or `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` env vars.
- Prefer surgical diffs; no speculative abstractions or extra features.
- Specs live in `docs/superpowers/specs/`; plans in `docs/superpowers/plans/`.
